---
// MVCC write: an UPDATE does not overwrite, it tags the old tuple and adds a new one.
// Same illustrative row as the visibility figure (acct #7, $250 to $600, tx 48).
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
---
<figure class="txmu">
  <div class="txmu-scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 250" role="img" aria-label="Before: one tuple, acct 7 with 250 dollars, inserted by tx 42, not deleted. Transaction 48 runs an update setting the balance to 600. After: the old tuple stays but is marked deleted by tx 48, and a new tuple with 600 dollars, inserted by tx 48, is added next to it.">
    <text x="20" y="26" class="h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>What one UPDATE does inside an MVCC table</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Một lệnh UPDATE làm gì trong bảng MVCC</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="30" y="62" class="sec"><tspan data-lang-en>Before</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Trước</tspan></text>
    <rect x="20" y="76" width="260" height="104" rx="6" class="txmu-box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="db" x={50} y={106} size={26} />
    <text x="76" y="110" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>acct #7: $250</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>acct #7: $250</tspan></text>
    <text x="36" y="140" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>inserted_by = tx 42</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>inserted_by = tx 42</tspan></text>
    <text x="36" y="160" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>deleted_by = (empty)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>deleted_by = (trống)</tspan></text>

    <path d="M290,128 L398,128" class="txmu-arrow" /><polygon points="406,128 398,124 398,132" class="txmu-head" />
    <text x="348" y="108" class="m" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>tx 48 runs</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>tx 48 chạy</tspan></text>
    <text x="348" y="148" class="note" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>SET balance = 600</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>SET balance = 600</tspan></text>

    <text x="420" y="62" class="sec"><tspan data-lang-en>After: two tuples on disk</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Sau: hai tuple trên đĩa</tspan></text>
    <rect x="420" y="76" width="220" height="104" rx="6" class="txmu-box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="db" x={450} y={106} size={26} />
    <text x="476" y="110" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>acct #7: $250</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>acct #7: $250</tspan></text>
    <text x="436" y="140" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>inserted_by = tx 42</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>inserted_by = tx 42</tspan></text>
    <text x="436" y="160" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>deleted_by = tx 48</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>deleted_by = tx 48</tspan></text>
    <rect x="660" y="76" width="220" height="104" rx="6" class="txmu-box is-ok" />
    <DiagramIcon name="db" x={690} y={106} size={26} />
    <text x="716" y="110" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>acct #7: $600</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>acct #7: $600</tspan></text>
    <text x="676" y="140" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>inserted_by = tx 48</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>inserted_by = tx 48</tspan></text>
    <text x="676" y="160" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>deleted_by = (empty)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>deleted_by = (trống)</tspan></text>
    <text x="530" y="204" class="note" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>old version, kept for older snapshots</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>bản cũ, giữ cho snapshot cũ</tspan></text>
    <text x="770" y="204" class="note is-ok" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>new version, visible after commit</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>bản mới, thấy được sau commit</tspan></text>
    <text x="450" y="236" class="note" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>Nothing is overwritten; vacuum removes the old tuple once no snapshot can read it.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Không có gì bị ghi đè; vacuum xoá tuple cũ khi không snapshot nào còn đọc được nó.</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>An update is a tag plus an insert. Readers with an older snapshot keep seeing the first tuple, newer readers see the second, and neither blocks the other. The transaction IDs are illustrative.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Update là một thẻ đánh dấu cộng một lần insert. Người đọc có snapshot cũ vẫn thấy tuple đầu, người đọc mới thấy tuple sau, không bên nào chặn bên nào. Các transaction ID chỉ để minh hoạ.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .txmu { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .txmu-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .txmu svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .txmu text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .txmu .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .txmu .sec { font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .txmu .sec.is-bad { fill: var(--red); }
  .txmu .b { font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .txmu .m { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .txmu .mono { font-family: var(--font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace); font-size: 12px; }
  .txmu .note { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .txmu .note.is-bad { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 600; }
  .txmu .note.is-ok { fill: var(--gold-icon); font-weight: 600; }
  .txmu .num { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .txmu-panel { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .txmu-panel.is-bad { stroke: var(--red); }
  .txmu-panel.is-ok { stroke: var(--gold); }
  .txmu-box { fill: var(--card-bg); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .txmu-box.is-bad { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .txmu-box.is-ok { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .txmu-dot { fill: var(--card-bg); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .txmu-arrow { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .txmu-arrow.is-bad { stroke: var(--red); }
  .txmu-arrow.is-ok { stroke: var(--gold); }
  .txmu-dash { stroke-dasharray: 4 4; }
  .txmu-head { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .txmu-head.is-bad { fill: var(--red); }
  .txmu-head.is-ok { fill: var(--gold); }
  .txmu-life { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-dasharray: 4 4; }
  .txmu figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.5; }
</style>
